msgid "Normal mode moves with h j k l and runs the keys below; v, V and Ctrl+V select; i and a rename (insert mode); Esc goes back to normal mode; : opens the command line. Keys with Ctrl or Alt that aren't listed here keep their usual meaning."
msgstr "Običajni način se premika s h j k l in izvaja spodnje tipke; v, V in Ctrl+V izbirajo; i in a preimenujeta (način vstavljanja); Esc se vrne v običajni način; : odpre ukazno vrstico. Tipke s Ctrl ali Alt, ki niso navedene tukaj, ohranijo običajen pomen."

